SCOPE index: [each] Lessons Twenty-four lessons of ten study hours each, which is 240 hours in total, and the hours shown are the ones each lesson page declares.
SCOPE index: [several] Lessons 15 to 19 cover functions of several variables, and Lessons 20 to 22 cover multiple integrals and the implicit-function and envelope theorems.
SCOPE index: [each] L05 · 10 h Differentiation Rules and the Chain Rule The product, quotient and chain rules, each proved from the definition with its hypotheses.
SCOPE index: [small] L13 · 10 h Finite-Difference Derivative Approximation Forward and central differences, their truncation errors, and the turn-up in error at small steps caused by rounding in arithmetic.
SCOPE index: [several] L15 · 10 h Euclidean Space, Open Sets and Functions of Several Variables Points and distances in the plane and in higher dimensions, open sets, and continuity of functions of two variables.
SCOPE index: [each] L16 · 10 h Partial Derivatives Each partial derivative as a one-variable derivative with the other variables held fixed, computed and checked.
SCOPE index: [several] L19 · 10 h Second-Order Taylor Expansion and the Hessian Matrix The Hessian of second partial derivatives, its symmetry, and the second-order expansion of a function of several variables.
SCOPE index: [each] L24 · 10 h Where Numerical Sensitivities Fail A finite-difference error sweep on a kink and near a cancellation, and the step sizes at which each method fails.
