SCOPE L06: [all ,each,every] E3 · Why every midpoint has a nonzero sign (from Lab 1) Lab 1 reports that the sign of \(f'\) at each interval midpoint agrees with the direction on all 16 intervals.
SCOPE L06: [each] Solution The grid endpoints are multiples of \(1/4\), so each interval's midpoint is an odd multiple of \(1/8\).
